---
import { CONTACT_EMAILS, WEB_LINKS } from '../lib/site';
const questions = [
  ['What is Gurudevi?', 'Gurudevi is an education ecology support system for teachers, students, schools, families, and communities. It brings practical work and respectful support into connected spaces.'],
  ['Who is it for?', 'Teachers are our first design beneficiary, but the ecology includes students, principals and school leaders, families, and community partners.'],
  ['When does it launch?', 'The public launch is planned for October 6, 2026, at 9:00 AM Sri Lanka time. Some parts of the platform may remain invite-only while we learn with early schools.'],
  ['What can a principal see?', 'School leaders can see the shared patterns needed for coordination and support. Personal reflections and private inner work are not treated as institutional surveillance.'],
  ['Does Gurudevi replace teachers?', 'No. Gurudevi is designed to reduce avoidable friction around teaching and learning so educators have more room for professional judgment and human connection.'],
  ['How can my school get involved?', `Write to ${CONTACT_EMAILS.institutional}. We are speaking with principals and school heads who want to explore a careful, invite-led transition.`],
];
---

<Layout title="Questions">
  <Header />
  <main><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h1>Clear answers for a living system.</h1><p>We are early, so we will be direct about what Gurudevi is, what it is not, and where the work is heading.</p></section><section class="section faq-list">{questions.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</section><section class="section contact-strip"><div><p class="eyebrow">Still wondering?</p><h2>Ask a human.</h2></div><div><p>We welcome practical questions from teachers, families, and school leaders.</p><a class="button button--dark" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAILS.support}`}>Contact support ↗</a></div></section></main><Footer />
</Layout>
